---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CtaBanner from "../components/CtaBanner.astro";
import { site, yearsPracticing } from "../data/site";
import headshot from "../assets/alexander-colwell-headshot.jpg";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Your Wisconsin Estate Planning Attorney"
  description={`Meet ${site.attorneyName} — a Wisconsin estate planning attorney and CPA based near Marshfield, serving Stevens Point, Wisconsin Rapids, and families statewide.`}
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-gold-700 uppercase">About</p>
    <h1 class="font-display mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-navy-900">
      Meet the Attorney Who'll Actually Handle Your Plan
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg text-ink-700">{site.attorneyName} &middot; Founder, {site.firmName}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] md:gap-14">
      <div>
        <Image
          src={headshot}
          alt={`Portrait of ${site.attorneyFirstLast}`}
          width={560}
          height={560}
          class="aspect-square w-full rounded-sm border border-navy-900/10 object-cover shadow-sm"
        />
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-sm border border-navy-900/10 bg-cream-200 p-5">
          <h2 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-navy-900 uppercase">Contact</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-700">
            <li><a href={site.phoneHref} class="hover:text-gold-700">{site.phone}</a></li>
            <li><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="hover:text-gold-700">{site.email}</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="mt-4 block rounded-sm bg-navy-900 px-5 py-3 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-cream-100 hover:bg-navy-700"
        >
          Schedule Your Consultation
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-legal max-w-2xl text-ink-700">
        <p class="text-lg">
          For {site.attorneyFirst}, estate planning has never really been about legal
          documents. It's about the phone call that <em>doesn't</em> have to happen — the one
          where a family member has to figure out probate court, guess at what you wanted, or
          scramble to get access to your accounts during the worst week of their life.
        </p>
        <p>
          {site.attorneyName} founded {site.firmName} to give Wisconsin families a
          straightforward, personal path to that peace of mind — without the confusing legal
          jargon, without the upsell, and without the office visit if you don't want one.
        </p>
        <p>
          {site.attorneyFirst} is based near Marshfield and works with clients throughout Stevens
          Point, Wisconsin Rapids, and — virtually — anywhere in Wisconsin.
        </p>

        <h2>An attorney who also thinks like a CPA</h2>
        <p>
          Alex passed the Wisconsin bar in 2017 and spent about two and a half years working
          in public accounting before deciding to focus his legal practice exclusively on estate
          planning. What sets him apart is that combination: legal training paired with a
          Certified Public Accountant's eye for the financial details. Estate plans don't just
          need to be legally valid — they need to make sense with your taxes, your accounts, and
          how your assets are actually titled. That combination catches issues that a purely
          legal (or purely financial) review might miss.
        </p>

        <h2>A personal approach, from start to finish</h2>
        <p>
          You won't be handed off to a paralegal or a call center. You'll work directly with
          Alex — from your first conversation through the day your plan is signed, and
          anytime you need to make changes down the road.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every family's situation is different, and documents drafted from a generic template
          rarely fit well. Alex takes the time to understand your goals — for your spouse,
          your children, your business, or your own care as you age — before recommending a plan
          built around them.
        </p>

        <h2>Credentials</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Licensed Wisconsin Attorney since {site.barAdmittedYear} ({yearsPracticing}+ years of experience)</li>
          <li>Certified Public Accountant (CPA)</li>
          <li>Focused on wills, revocable living trusts, probate, trust administration, powers of attorney, and special needs planning</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16">
      <CtaBanner
        heading="Start Your Estate Plan Today"
        subtext="Schedule a free, no-pressure consultation with Alex and get clear answers about what your family actually needs."
      />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
